### Test Address Creation API
POST http://localhost:8080/oldtech/addresses/create?userId=123
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer YOUR_JWT_TOKEN_HERE

{
  "city": "Ho Chi Minh",
  "district": "District 1", 
  "ward": "Ben Nghe",
  "street": "Nguyen Hue",
  "detailedAddress": "123 Nguyen Hue Boulevard",
  "addressType": "home",
  "isDefault": true
}

